   "type": "bargauge",
   "id": 9,
   "title": "Channels and searches",
   "description": "Channels: a slot opened from the Channels tab. Searches with a query, and videos played once per room, over the time range. Includes the owner's own testing: the TEST world uses the same service and these counts can't tell them apart (most of 10-26's Channels plays were testing).",
   "datasource": {
